We going to implement the most important part of the project. Tool scope
[descope_api.py](sandbox_orchestrator/core/descope_api.py) 
[mcp_endpoints.py](sandbox_orchestrator/api/mcp_endpoints.py) 
when we create mcp we create a scope for each tool.
first when usee toggles mcp send the slug to fastapi_chatbot
now when a user sends a msg and start a chat stream, i want you to send the user role  and user id via the stream json.
before any mcp tool call is made [tool_executor.py](fastapi_chatbot/core/tool_executor.py) check if the user has the role required for the tool scope.
if not return an error message "You do not have the required role to use this tool. please upgrade to premium to access this tool"
